          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Grand Finale"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(mental, occult)\n\nRequirements: The muse phantom's thespian aura is active\n\nThe muse ceases its thespian aura and deals 4d8 mental damage to creatures in a 30-foot burst, including the creature it is possessing, if any (DC 22 basic Will save). Creatures that fail their Will saves are fascinated by the muse phantom for 1 minute. The muse phantom can't use Grand Finale again for 1d4 rounds."
            },
